    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "This isn’t just another coaching application. This is the first honest step toward building the private practice you keep envisioning —the one that pays you well, fits your life, and lets you lead with purpose (not hustle and burnout)."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "I take on a limited number of clinicians at a time—because this isn’t surface-level coaching. It’s deep, strategic, personal, and tailored to your goals, your vision, and the business you want to grow."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "So please take your time as you complete this form. Your answers help me understand where you are now, where you want to be, and whether I’m the right coach to help you get there."
    },
